# WIN-CHS_RT-POSIX AUDIT — Phase 0 research, sub-agent B

File: openOODA/audit/win_chs_rt_posix_audit.oot
Date: 2026-08-19. Lane: read-only audit. Owner: openOODA owner. Cross-ref: openOODA/audit/win_compiler_plan.oot.
Scope: every POSIX-only or Linux-only call in ooda/runtime/chs_rt_*.c, oo_*.c, and chs_rt.h.
Method: targeted greps over ooda/runtime for headers, syscalls, fork/exec, pthread, socket, fs. Each row cites file:line.

## 1. Files audited

42 chs_rt_*.c files, 3 oo_*.c files, 1 main header (chs_rt.h), 3 sub-headers.

chs_rt_actor.c, chs_rt_alloc.c, chs_rt_arena.c, chs_rt_caps.c, chs_rt_channel.c, chs_rt_crypto.c, chs_rt_dns.c, chs_rt_emit_tmp.c, chs_rt_fetch.c, chs_rt_ffi.c, chs_rt_ffi_sec.c, chs_rt_flist.c, chs_rt_fs.c, chs_rt_hash.c, chs_rt_hitl.c, chs_rt_host.c, chs_rt_landlock.c, chs_rt_libfloor.c, chs_rt_list.c, chs_rt_list_set.c, chs_rt_llist.c, chs_rt_llist_f.c, chs_rt_llist_s.c, chs_rt_math.c, chs_rt_meta.c, chs_rt_netfloor.c, chs_rt_print.c, chs_rt_rlimit.c, chs_rt_str.c, chs_rt_str_intern.c, chs_rt_str_int.c, chs_rt_str_ops.c, chs_rt_str_tok.c, chs_rt_sys.c, chs_rt_thread.c, chs_rt_time_rand.c, chs_rt_tls.c, chs_rt_vision.c, chs_rt_wasm.c, chs_rt_wasm_print.c, chs_rt_xlang.c. oo_holo.c, oo_hide.c, oo_sha256.c. Headers: chs_rt.h, chs_rt_dns.h, chs_rt_landlock.h, chs_rt_rlimit.h.

